/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 57 0 R
/T (Title: An Agentic AI Framework for Reliable and Evidence-Based Automated Code Review )
/E (Title: An Agentic AI Framework for Reliable and Evidence-Based Automated Code Review )
/Pg 11 0 R
