/P 58 0 R
/E (Existing AI-based code review systems can analyze code and generate review suggestions, but a single Large Language Model \(LLM\) may produce false positives, miss important defects, hallucinate issues, or lack sufficient repository-level context. Static-analysis tools, on the other hand, can reliably detect predefined patterns but have limited understanding of program intent and complex logic.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
